      "id": "01-signin",
      "instruction": "Sign in to Odoo at http://127.0.0.1:8069/ with login 'admin' and password 'admin' (the login form is already showing). After signing in, navigate to the Sales app (Sales > Customers, or via the apps menu). Create a new customer contact with name exactly '{{runid}} Bench Customer' and City set to 'Benchville' (leave other fields default). Save it. Then verify the customer exists by reopening its form and report the name and city values you see on the page. Do not wait for network idle - the app long-polls; wait for concrete page state instead.",
      "skill": "s_d5fb6c",
      "params": {
        "v2": "{{runid}} Bench Customer",
        "v3": "Benchville",
        "v1": "{{runid}}"
      },
      "outputs": [
        "customer_name",
        "city",
        "login_used",
        "customer_ref"
      ],
